Looking at this hypothesis, I need to replace the pointwise log-loss objective with pairwise ranking loss (BPR - Bayesian Personalized Ranking), grouping samples by user.

Key changes:
1. Create helper to group samples by user and form positive/negative pairs
2. Add `step_pairwise` method to FM that computes BPR loss: `-log(sigmoid(z_pos - z_neg))`
3. Modify training loop to create pairs and call pairwise step

